WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.897
- There're people who look up to
you who don't do what you do.

00:00:05.517 --> 00:00:08.148
- You mean everybody?

00:00:08.148 --> 00:00:09.968
You mean everybody?

00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:12.298
Do you know how many 
people tweet hustle and

00:00:12.298 --> 00:00:15.297
work six hours a day?

00:00:15.297 --> 00:00:16.168
I know.
- I'm serious.

00:00:16.168 --> 00:00:16.888
- I know.

00:00:16.888 --> 00:00:19.148
- I'm serious. Someone I'm very 
close to today asks me about

00:00:19.148 --> 00:00:21.969
my schedule and I told him
the schedule and then they asked

00:00:21.969 --> 00:00:26.627
me well why are you up so early?
(laughter)

00:00:26.627 --> 00:00:29.278
- Yeah. Let's move to the next
question before I get angry.

00:00:31.228 --> 00:00:33.149
By the way, real
quick I got angry.

00:00:33.149 --> 00:00:36.419
If you ever say to somebody 
else why are you up so early,

00:00:36.419 --> 00:00:39.529
that is the quickest tell to 
you are not a winning player.

00:00:39.529 --> 00:00:43.188
If that has ever crossed
your mind, you've lost.

00:00:43.188 --> 00:00:45.213
(alarm beeping)

